---
// src/components/sections/Insights.astro
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-[#02040a] relative border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-20 gap-8">
            <div class="max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="font-heading text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-brand-glow uppercase mb-3">Engineering Blog</h2>
                <h3 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white">Latest <span class="text-brand-accent">Insights.</span></h3>
            </div>
            <a href="/blog" class="inline-flex items-center text-brand-accent font-bold hover:text-white transition-colors">
                Read All Articles <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" /></svg>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <article class="group cursor-pointer">
                <div class="w-full h-60 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-6 relative">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-dark/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-500 z-10"></div>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555949963-ff9fe0c870eb?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Code Editor" class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-accent uppercase tracking-wider">Architecture</span>
                    <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Jul 12, 2026</span>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-glow transition-colors">Why we build Enterprise Web Apps with Astro and React</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">Exploring the performance benefits of zero-JS architectures and partial hydration for B2B SaaS platforms.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="group cursor-pointer">
                <div class="w-full h-60 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-6 relative">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-dark/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-500 z-10"></div>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620712943543-bcc4688e7485?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="AI Circuit" class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-accent uppercase tracking-wider">Artificial Intelligence</span>
                    <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Jul 05, 2026</span>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-glow transition-colors">Implementing RAG Systems for Corporate Data Structuring</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">How Retrieval-Augmented Generation is transforming the way massive corporate datasets are processed.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="group cursor-pointer">
                <div class="w-full h-60 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-6 relative">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-dark/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-500 z-10"></div>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550751827-4bd374c3f58b?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Cyber Security" class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-accent uppercase tracking-wider">Security</span>
                    <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Jun 28, 2026</span>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-glow transition-colors">Scaling Node.js Microservices Safely using AWS</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">A technical deep-dive into establishing secure pipelines and load balancing for high-traffic financial applications.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>